1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,963
Immunity.

2
00:00:00,963 --> 00:00:07,916
Innate immunity is with you from birth: skin, mucus, stomach acid, phagocytes.

3
00:00:07,916 --> 00:00:10,494
Acquired immunity is specific.

4
00:00:10,494 --> 00:00:18,072
It is active when your own body makes the antibodies, after an infection or a vaccine, with memory that lasts.

5
00:00:18,072 --> 00:00:26,484
It is passive when antibodies are handed over ready made: across the placenta, in colostrum, or as an antiserum.

6
00:00:26,484 --> 00:00:28,125
Quick, but short lived.

